  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S.Prabhu vs The Food Safety Officer on 13 January, 2020 Author: C.Saravanan Bench: C.Saravanan W.P.No.30196 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 13.01.2020 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice C.Saravanan W.P.No.30196 of 2016 and W.M.P.Nos.26177, 26178 & 26179 of 2016 S.Prabhu ... Petiti vs The Food Safety Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration, Coimbatore Corporation, Coimbatore. ... Respon Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of Ind issue Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call for the seizure mem dated 18.07.2016, on the file of the respondent herein and to quas the same as illegal and direct the respondent to release the seize Tabacco of 900 Kilograms under 25 numbers of bags to the petitioner.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2.The learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the issue is covered by the following two decision of this Court:- i. Jayavilas Tabacco Traders LLP Vs. The Designated Officer, The Food Safety & Drugs Control Dept., 2017 SCC OnLine Mad 2458. ii. M/ 3.However, the learned counsel for the petitioner submits that no notice has been issued so far after the impugned seizure memo was issued seizing HANS CHHAP TABACCO of 900 Kg under 25 number of bags.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2.The learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the issue is covered by the following two decision of this Court:- i. Jayavilas Tabacco Traders LLP Vs. The Designated Officer, The Food Safety & Drugs Control Dept., 2017 SCC OnLine Mad 2458. ii. M/ 3.However, the learned counsel for the petitioner submits that no notice has been issued so far after the impugned seizure memo was issued seizing HANS CHHAP TABACCO of 900 Kg under 25 number of bags.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
